idents.","translation":"Esta norma ayuda a prevenir accidentes.","audio":"prevent.ogg"},{"word":"depend","meaning":"depender","example":"It depends on the weather.","translation":"Depende del tiempo.","audio":"depend.ogg"},{"word":"accept","meaning":"aceptar","example":"He accepted the invitation.","translation":"Aceptó la invitación.","audio":"accept.ogg"},{"word":"refuse","meaning":"rechazar; negarse","example":"She refused the offer.","translation":"Rechazó la oferta.","audio":"refuse.ogg"},{"word":"claim","meaning":"afirmar","example":"He claims he saw the accident.","translation":"Afirma que vio el accidente.","audio":"claim.ogg"},{"word":"expect","meaning":"esperar; prever","example":"I expect the bus to arrive soon.","translation":"Espero que el autobús llegue pronto.","audio":"expect.ogg"},{"word":"recommend","meaning":"recomendar","example":"I recommend this restaurant.","translation":"Recomiendo este restaurante.","audio":"recommend.ogg"},{"word":"complain","meaning":"quejarse","example":"Customers complain about the noise.","translation":"Los clientes se quejan del ruido.","audio":"complain.ogg"},{"word":"attend","meaning":"asistir","example":"I attend a class on Mondays.","translation":"Asisto a clase los lunes.","audio":"attend.ogg"},{"word":"apply","meaning":"solicitar","example":"She applied for a new job.","translation":"Solicitó un trabajo nuevo.","audio":"apply.ogg"},{"word":"assume","meaning":"suponer","example":"Don't assume everyone agrees.","translation":"No des por hecho que todos están de acuerdo.","audio":"assume.ogg"},{"word":"replace","meaning":"sustituir","example":"We need to replace the old chair.","translation":"Tenemos que sustituir la silla vieja.","audio":"replace.ogg"},{"word":"include","meaning":"incluir","example":"The price includes breakfast.","translation":"El precio incluye el desayuno.","audio":"include.ogg"},{"word":"remain","meaning":"permanecer; quedar","example":"Only two tickets remain.","translation":"Solo quedan dos entradas.","audio":"remain.ogg"},{"word":"afford","meaning":"poder permitirse","example":"I can't afford a new car.","translation":"No puedo permitirme un coche nuevo.","audio":"afford.ogg"},{"word":"approach","meaning":"acercarse; enfoque","example":"The train is approaching the station.","translation":"El tren se está acercando a la estación.","audio":"approach.ogg"},{"word":"benefit","meaning":"beneficio; beneficiar","example":"Exercise has many benefits.","translation":"El ejercicio tiene muchos beneficios.","audio":"benefit.ogg"}],"B2":[{"word":"assess","meaning":"evaluar","example":"We need to assess the results.","translation":"Tenemos que evaluar los resultados.","audio":"assess.ogg"},{"word":"derive","meaning":"derivar; obtener","example":"The word derives from Latin.","translation":"La palabra deriva del latín.","audio":"derive.ogg"},{"word":"implement","meaning":"poner en práctica","example":"They implemented a new policy.","translation":"Pusieron en práctica una nueva política.","audio":"implement.ogg"},{"word":"justify","meaning":"justificar","example":"Can you justify your decision?","translation":"¿Puedes justificar tu decisión?","audio":"justify.ogg"},{"word":"maintain","meaning":"mantener","example":"It's hard to maintain this pace.","translation":"Es difícil mantener este ritmo.","audio":"maintain.ogg"},{"word":"negotiate","meaning":"negociar","example":"They negotiated a better price.","translation":"Negociaron un precio mejor.","audio":"negotiate.ogg"},{"word":"perceive","meaning":"percibir","example":"People perceive the change differently.","translation":"La gente percibe el cambio de forma distinta.","audio":"perceive.ogg"},{"word":"resolve","meaning":"resolver","example":"We resolved the problem together.","translation":"Resolvimos el problema juntos.","audio":"resolve.ogg"},{"word":"retain","meaning":"conservar","example":"She retains a copy of every letter.","translation":"Conserva una copia de cada carta.","audio":"retain.ogg"},{"word":"wit